#. translators: 1: context 2: exception message
#: modules/core/core.php:242
msgid "Process failed via %1$s: %2$s"
msgstr "Proceso fallido vía %1$s: %2$s"

#. translators: %s: exception message
#: modules/core/core.php:245
msgid "Process failed: %s"
msgstr "Proceso fallido: %s"

#. translators: %s: amount of time
#: modules/core/core.php:258
msgid ""
"Scheduled exports: Process marked as failed after %s seconds. Unknown error "
"occurred. Check server, PHP and database error logs to diagnose cause."
msgstr ""
"Exportaciones programadas: Proceso marcado como fallido después de %s "
"segundos. Se ha producido un error desconocido. Comprueba los registros de "
"errores del servidor, PHP y la base de datos para diagnosticar la causa."

#: modules/core/core.php:468
msgid ""
"This means the job is scheduled for a future date and it will be executed "
"automatically in the future."
msgstr ""
"Esto significa que la tarea está programada para una fecha futura y se "
"ejecutará automáticamente en el futuro."

#: modules/core/core.php:469
msgid ""
"This means the job was successfully executed and it won't run again. If this "
"is a real-time sync, the first full run has been completed and it's "
"listening and monitoring for changes right now."
msgstr ""
"Esto significa que la tarea se ha ejecutado correctamente y no se ejecutará "
"de nuevo. Si se trata de una sincronización en tiempo real, la primera "
"ejecución completa se ha completado y estamos escuchando y monitoreando los "
"cambios en este momento."

#: modules/core/core.php:470
msgid ""
"This means the job will no longer be used for anything, it's archived for "
"historical purposes only and it can be deleted once you no longer need to "
"review its log."
msgstr ""
"Esto significa que la tarea ya no se utilizará para nada, se archivará solo "
"con fines históricos y se podrá eliminar cuando ya no necesites revisar el "
"registro de la misma."

#: modules/core/core.php:471
msgid ""
"This means that the job is running at this moment, it's processing all its "
"related batches."
msgstr ""
"Esto significa que la tarea se está ejecutando en este momento, está "
"procesando todos los lotes relacionados."

#: modules/core/core.php:472
msgid ""
"This means that the job has been cancelled and removed from the schedule, it "
"won't run again and it won't be used for anything"
msgstr ""
"Esto significa que la tarea ha sido cancelada y eliminada de la "
"programación, no volverá a ejecutarse y no se utilizará para nada."

#: modules/core/core.php:473
msgid ""
"This means that there was an error when executing this job and it was marked "
"as failed so you review the log to find out what happened, you can edit the "
"job and manually schedule it to run again when you fix the issue."
msgstr ""
"Esto significa que hubo un error al ejecutar esta tarea y se marcó como "
"fallida, así que revisa el registro para averiguar qué sucedió. Puedes "
"editar la tarea y programarla manualmente para que se ejecute de nuevo "
"cuando soluciones el problema."

#: modules/core/core.php:474
msgid ""
"The job was temporarily paused and removed from the schedule. It will not "
"run on its originally scheduled date but can be resumed later. If the "
"original date hasn't passed, it will execute on the original date when "
"resumed. If the original date has already passed, it will be rescheduled to "
"run at the time of resumption. If the job was paused during a batch, the "
"current batch will continue to be processed. However, the next batch will "
"not be processed until the job is resumed."
msgstr ""
"La tarea se ha detenido temporalmente y se ha eliminado de la programación. "
"No se ejecutará en la fecha originalmente programada, pero puede reanudarse "
"más tarde. Si la fecha original no ha pasado, se ejecutará en la fecha "
"original cuando se reanude. Si la fecha original ya ha pasado, se "
"reprogramará para ejecutarse en el momento de la reanudación. Si la tarea se "
"ha detenido durante un lote, el lote actual seguirá procesándose. Sin "
"embargo, el siguiente lote no se procesará hasta que se reanude la tarea."

#: modules/core/core.php:475
msgid ""
"The job will be returned to its previous state before it was archived. If "
"the previous state was scheduled and the date has not passed yet, it will be "
"automatically rescheduled to run on the same date. However, if the "
"previously scheduled date has already passed, it will run immediately. If "
"the job was archived during execution, it will resume from where it left "
"off. If the job was a real-time sync, it will resume its function of "
"listening and monitoring for changes."
msgstr ""
"La tarea volverá a su estado anterior antes de ser archivada. Si el estado "
"anterior era \"programada\" y la fecha aún no ha pasado, se reprogramará "
"automáticamente para ejecutarse en la misma fecha. Sin embargo, si la fecha "
"previamente programada ya ha pasado, se ejecutará inmediatamente. Si la "
"tarea se archivó durante su ejecución, se reanudará desde donde se dejó. Si "
"la tarea era una sincronización en tiempo real, reanudará su función de "
"escucha y supervisión de cambios."

